    {
      "id": "u_283c6179e01ebe47f2c72222_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Right-clicking the content of some note types such as __TRILIUM_PH_0__Text__TRILIUM_PH_1__ or __TRILIUM_PH_2__Code__TRILIUM_PH_3__ reveals a contextual menu.",
      "sourceHash": "283c6179e01ebe47f2c722223fc63a1e82525081bcb2c338fd87944e1cafffeb",
      "context": "Note contextual menu",
      "contextHash": "5d7ae59dccc3076ddb3d18970dd9f095c59fcda654660ff65ad6b36121821fa9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4beb21bc95c4c5dc92add503_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "In a text note being edited, right-clicking a link opens the menu of the link instead, the same as its __TRILIUM_PH_0__More actions__TRILIUM_PH_1__ menu (see __TRILIUM_PH_2__External links__TRILIUM_PH_3__ and __TRILIUM_PH_4__Internal (reference) links__TRILIUM_PH_5__). A selection holding the link and more text keeps the contextual menu.",
      "sourceHash": "4beb21bc95c4c5dc92add5032d330f004de088f6b5fac8fdb4a4472f7bcb8dca",
      "context": "Note contextual menu",
      "contextHash": "5d7ae59dccc3076ddb3d18970dd9f095c59fcda654660ff65ad6b36121821fa9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
