    {
      "id": "u_466642a30c58d5c6fad0913b_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "On the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Desktop Installation__TRILIUM_PH_1__, the __TRILIUM_PH_2__Spell Check__TRILIUM_PH_3__ suggestions are shown when right clicking on a misspelled word.",
      "sourceHash": "466642a30c58d5c6fad0913bda3e16582e462250ec901105a8c8e095f5f133b2",
      "context": "Note contextual menu > Features",
      "contextHash": "f577e831c17c9bae9eaedb08727044817e355189bfae60a9f91699c0d57f549b",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_94ac2027757f53e468cb2bda_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The selected text can be searched either with a search engine (configured in __TRILIUM_PH_0__Options__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__Other__TRILIUM_PH_3__) or __TRILIUM_PH_4__inside Trilium__TRILIUM_PH_5__.",
      "sourceHash": "94ac2027757f53e468cb2bda51b0204213b25bed7e05dc012dd679a83bc5a095",
      "context": "Note contextual menu > Features",
      "contextHash": "f577e831c17c9bae9eaedb08727044817e355189bfae60a9f91699c0d57f549b",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_579c163d753ddb27c68b7a02_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To remove the web search from the menu, choose __TRILIUM_PH_0__None__TRILIUM_PH_1__ as the search engine.",
      "sourceHash": "579c163d753ddb27c68b7a026da3df8e21d6008a5e06c3d5fa23245cbfe22eac",
      "context": "Note contextual menu > Features",
      "contextHash": "f577e831c17c9bae9eaedb08727044817e355189bfae60a9f91699c0d57f549b",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3182e514610f9955adf4ac31_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Basic clipboard functionality (cut, copy, paste).",
